  "question": {
    "text": "For the reaction  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo></math>  initially concentrations of a and b are equal and at equilibrium the concentration of d will be twice of that of a. What will be the equilibrium constant for the reaction?"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></munder><mo>⇌</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></munder></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>"
  }
